   SuperscriptBox["RTR", 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7a600c16-cccf-4b3d-93ea-dea3f3fac306"],
 "\nTo get the new tensor you apply the rotation matrix R and its inverse ",
